  "details": "New design does not properly seperate \"Online Friends\" | \"Friends in Private Worlds\" | \"Friends on Website\" as it does not use proper dividers to categorize them as it used to do before (before there was white text when a new category starts). Current design makes the eyes glaze over, making it hard to categorize and use the information properly.\n\nCurrent design does not show the \"trust ranking\" border color. This was useful for when purging your friends list for users that you've met once months ago and are still visitor. (Clearly Inactive)",
